# ==============================================================================
# Franchise Reactive API — End-to-End Request Suite (.http / REST Client)
# ==============================================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/franchises

### 1. Create a new Franchise (Criterion #2)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Franquicia Café Colombia"
}

### 2. [Bonus] Update Franchise Name
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Franquicia Café Internacional"
}

### 3. Add a new Branch to the Franchise (Criterion #3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/1/branches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sucursal Medellín"
}

### 4. [Bonus] Update Branch Name
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/1/branches/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sucursal El Poblado"
}

### 5. Add a new Product to the Branch (Criterion #4)
POST {{baseUrl}}/1/branches/1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Café Origen Antioquia",
  "stock": 140
}

### 6. Modify Product Stock (Criterion #6)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/1/branches/1/products/1/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": 280
}

### 7. [Bonus] Update Product Name
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/1/branches/1/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Café Origen Reserva Especial"
}

### 8. Get Top Stock Product per Branch for a Franchise (Criterion #7)
GET {{baseUrl}}/1/top-stock-products
Accept: application/json

### 9. Get Full Franchise Hierarchy Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/1
Accept: application/json

### 10. Remove a Product from a Branch (Criterion #5)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/1/branches/1/products/1
